# E22-migrants-now -- E22 migrant trials with migrants-now: `force Migrants` returned success but no migrant reached the map in 36,000 ticks (citizens stayed at seven). Same design with `migrants-now` instead, two trials, levers armed.
run 20260917-195259 fort CTRL backup CTRL.preverify
DF v0.53.16 win64 STEAM DFHack 53.16-r1.1 world The Legendary Dimension site 32 tiles 29..29,20..20 seed WILDERPOP1
commits: DwarfCron 02447a3 seasonal-wildlife 1456f00 fps cap 1000

## Predictions (written before the run)
- the relation is pairwise between wild units only: merchants, pack animals and migrants never appear in a predator's combat reports beyond the control's rate; megabeast arrival leaves arrivals and departures unchanged
- armed predators are generally hostile: lever arms show merchant, pack-animal or citizen combat and deaths the controls do not
- a forced event is ignored or never reaches the map: the event probe shows nothing new for the whole run in both arms; that event needs a different trigger

